{"page":398,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:15","surah":29,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ وَأَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلسَّفِينَةِ وَجَعَلْنَـٰهَآ ءَايَةً لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We saved him and those with him on the Ark. We made this a sign for all people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"But We saved him","transliteration":"fa-anjaynāhu","verse_key":"29:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَأَصْحَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"and (the) people","transliteration":"wa-aṣḥāba","verse_key":"29:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّفِينَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the ship","transliteration":"l-safīnati","verse_key":"29:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهَآ","en_gloss":"and We made it","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhā","verse_key":"29:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَايَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a Sign","transliteration":"āyatan","verse_key":"29:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"for the worlds","transliteration":"lil'ʿālamīna","verse_key":"29:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:15"}]},{"verse_key":"29:16","surah":29,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ إِذْ قَالَ لِقَوْمِهِ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱتَّقُوهُ ۖ ذَٰلِكُمْ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We also sent Abraham. He said to his people, ‘Serve God and be mindful of Him: that is better for you, if only you knew.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"And Ibrahim ","transliteration":"wa-ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"29:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"29:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"29:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِقَوْمِهِ","en_gloss":"to his people","transliteration":"liqawmihi","verse_key":"29:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"Worship","transliteration":"uʿ'budū","verse_key":"29:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"29:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"and fear Him","translitera