","surah":29,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن تُكَذِّبُوا۟ فَقَدْ كَذَّبَ أُمَمٌ مِّن قَبْلِكُمْ ۖ وَمَا عَلَى ٱلرَّسُولِ إِلَّا ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you say this is a lie, [be warned that] other communities before you said the same. The messenger’s only duty is to give clear warning.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُكَذِّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"you deny","transliteration":"tukadhibū","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then verily","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُمَمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(the) nations","transliteration":"umamun","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","en_gloss":"the conveyance","transliteration":"l-balāghu","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","verse_key":"29:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:18"}]},{"verse_key":"29:19","surah":29,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ كَيْفَ يُبْدِئُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥٓ ۚ إِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ يَسِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not see that God brings life into being and reproduces it? Truly this is easy for God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do n